  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true
    },
    "description": "Read one item in full by an id that abdm_search returned. The id's shape says what it is: an atom id such as hiecm.error.abdm-1035 returns the atom's fields and markdown body; an operationId such as linkAddContexts returns the exact OpenAPI contract; fhir:\u003cprofile name or ABDM hiType\u003e, such as fhir:OPConsultRecord, returns the NRCES profile digest; fhir-example:\u003chiType\u003e, such as fhir-example:OPConsultation, returns a known-good document bundle. An unknown id is an error that names the closest valid ids.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "description": "an id exactly as abdm_search returned it: hiecm.error.abdm-1035, linkAddContexts, fhir:OPConsultRecord or fhir-example:OPConsultation",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "abdm_get",
    "outputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "catalogue_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "atom",
            "operation",
            "fhir_profile",
            "fhir_example"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "catalogue_version",
        "id",
        "kind"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true
    },
    "description": "Walk the catalogue graph from one atom id, both directions. Related atoms come back grouped by their own type (concept, flow, endpoint, callback, error, test, ...), each atom once. Use this to move from one exact atom to its neighbours; use abdm_search when you do not have a starting atom.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "description": "an atom id, for example hiecm.flow.m2-link-care-context",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "abdm_related",
    "outputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "catalogue_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "related": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "catalogue_version",
        "id",
        "related"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true
    },
    "description": "Find anything in the ABDM catalogue and get back ids that abdm_get opens. With a query it ranks the written guidance (atoms: concepts, flows, endpoints, callbacks, errors, tests, glossary entries, decisions, FHIR mappings, sandbox notes, troubleshooting) by hybrid keyword and semantic search. kind operation matches API operations whose operationId, summary or path contains every word of the query; kind fhir_profile does the same for the NRCES FHIR profiles. With an empty query and a kind it lists that kind, filtered and paginated: pass next_offset back as offset for the next page. response_format concise (the default) returns id, kind, title, summary and url per result; detailed adds type, milestone and snippet for atoms, and method, path, module and tag for operations.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "gateway": {
          "description": "atoms only: one gateway's atoms; shared atoms always come too",
          "enum": [
            "hiecm",
            "nhcx",
            "uhi"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "description": "what to return: atom (written guidance), operation (API operations), fhir_profile (NRCES profiles) or any",
          "enum": [
            "any",
            "atom",
            "operation",
            "fhir_profile"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "limit": {
          "description": "results per call: default 10 with a query and 25 for a listing, at most 25 for an atom query and 100 otherwise",
          "maximum": 100,
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "milestone": {
          "description": "atoms only: M1 to M4 or P1 to P4",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "module": {
          "description": "operations only: the specification module, for example gateway, m1 or m2",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "offset": {
          "description": "skip this many results: the next_offset of the previous page",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "query": {
          "description": "what to look for: your own words, an error code, an operationId or a path. Leave empty, with a kind, to list that kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "response_format": {
          "description": "concise (default) or detailed",
          "enum": [
            "concise",
            "detailed"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "description": "atoms only: the atom type",
          "enum": [
            "concept",
            "flow",
            "endpoint",
            "callback",
            "error",
            "test",
            "glossary",
            "decision",
            "fhir",
            "sandbox",
            "troubleshooting"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "abdm_search",
    "outputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "catalogue_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "results": {
          "items": {
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "atom",
                  "operation",
                  "fhir_profile"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "kind",
              "title"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          },
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "catalogue_version",
        "results"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true
    },
    "description": "Check something locally before sending it anywhere. kind request validates a candidate request body (body, raw JSON) against one operation's schema (operation_id) and lists the required headers and parameters that body validation cannot see. kind fhir runs a structural pre-flight check of a FHIR document bundle (bundle_json, optionally record_type) against the pinned NRCES profiles and ABDM transport rules, returning findings with locations and fixes; it does not validate terminology and does not replace the official HL7 validator, whose recipe the catalogue carries. The bundle is never logged.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "body": {
          "description": "kind request: the candidate request body as raw JSON",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bundle_json": {
          "description": "kind fhir: the FHIR document bundle, as a JSON string",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "description": "request or fhir",
          "enum": [
            "request",
            "fhir"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "operation_id": {
          "description": "kind request: the operationId, from abdm_search with kind operation",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "record_type": {
          "description": "kind fhir: optional expected ABDM hiType, for example OPConsultation",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "abdm_validate",
    "outputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "catalogue_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "request",
            "fhir"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "catalogue_version",
        "kind"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
